If any of you gave a cup of cold water to the youngest of these who follow me, truly I tell you, that person will certainly be rewarded."
Jesus and John the Baptist.
Jesus finished teaching his twelve disciples. Then he went to teach and preach in the cities of Galilee.
John was in prison. When he heard what Christ was doing, he sent his disciples to him.
They asked Jesus, "Are you the one who is to come, or shall we look for another?"
Jesus answered, "Go and tell John what you hear and what you see."
The blind receive their sight. The paralyzed walk. Skin diseases are healed. The deaf hear. The dead are raised to life. And good news brings joy to the poor.
Blessed are those who do not renounce their faith for my sake.
